.vercel

# Playwright
test-results/
playwright-report/
.env*

# Staging env files hold only a localhost API port, no secrets, and are
# committed so the staging stack works on a fresh clone. The root .gitignore
# negates these too, but a nested .gitignore wins for files in its own
# directory, so the exception has to be repeated here.
!.env.staging
!.env.staging-desktop
